13.6 Why should we use while with wait()?

Example

while(buffer.isEmpty()){
    wait();
}

Reason

After

🔴 notifyAll();
🔴 many threads wake up.
🔴 Only one may proceed.
🔴 Others should check the condition again.
🔴 This also protects against spurious wakeups.

13.7 Complete Comparison

| Feature                  | `notify()`         | `notifyAll()`       |
| ------------------------ | ------------------ | ------------------- |
| Class                    | Object             | Object              |
| Wakes                    | One waiting thread | All waiting threads |
| Releases Lock            | ❌ No               | ❌ No                |
| Scheduler Chooses Thread | Yes                | All compete         |
| Performance              | Better             | More overhead       |
| Safer                    | Less               | More                |
| Risk of Missed Progress  | Higher             | Lower               |
